# The build context for devops/backfill/Dockerfile is this whole directory,
# because the backfill's SQL rule lives in devops/sql. Everything else in here
# is charts, dashboards and alert rules that no image needs -- and, on a
# developer's machine, possibly gitignored .env files. Send only what is built.
*
!backfill/
!sql/
backfill/backfill
